  "title": "The First Conversation",
  "summary": "Paul chega a uma pequena cafeteria, pede algo para beber e começa uma conversa simples com outra pessoa.",
  "audio_url": "/audios/book-17.mp3",
  "word_count_target": 150,
  "story_en": "Paul walks down the street and sees a small cafe. He opens the door and looks around. A woman is sitting at a table near the window. Paul walks to the counter and asks for a coffee. The man behind the counter smiles and asks if he wants anything to eat. Paul says he is not hungry, but he wants some water too. He takes his coffee and sits at a table. After a few minutes, the woman looks at him and smiles. She asks if the seat is free. Paul says yes and moves his bag. She sits down and asks where he is going. Paul tells her about his trip. They talk for a while, and Paul feels happy because his first conversation of the day is easy and natural.",
